Z||000000||fldevel||11-12-2000||04:03 PM||||every saturday night i usualy go up to my local car club.. it all usualy ends aroung 9:00 well one night i stayed and BS'd for a while and noticed a bunch of ricers pulling in ..one of the guys stated that it was a new car club called "Rollin Phat" ..so when i left i decided to pull over there and kinda bust horns ..as i was pulling over <BR>there  i got many stares as there mere chainsaw sounding exhaust didnt quite sound like the rumbling GT ..so i pulled into a parking space in front of a acura integra ..that i kid you not ..probibly could have flown "literaly"  with that oversized wing on the back (was bigger than the car) so as im pulling in im already having people aske me what ive got in it .. as i step out of the car i have a small croud in FRONT of my car so i poped the hood "the front one" and showd them what was in there .. the times you wish you had a camra to see the looks on there faces "oh the engine is in the back ??" after chatting with them for a few minutes it was time to get home ..as me and a few of the ricers pulled out onto the highway,a civic with some gawdy looking body mods pulls up beside me  ..as we pull up to the stop light he revvs his engine .. the light turnd green ..and he puts on a smoke show .. all this time of paying attention to my car he dident notice the cop that pulled up right behind him at the light :P i laughed all the way home .. <P>fiero-1<BR>ricer-0<p>[This message has been edited by fldevel (edited 11-12-2000).]||||reg||1
