Z||000008||fldevel||11-13-2000||04:39 PM||||Doh .. if i knew this was gunna start a war i wouldent have posted it. there are some import cars that look decent with some mild mods but most of these cars where a bit rediculous .. one car (dont remember the make) had tires small enough to put on a go-kart with a wing on it that looked like it was cut from a 747 .. their was a maxima there that looked decent ... i think ill go next week and see what they think of my new pine tree air freshiner mod .. ||||reg||1
Z||000009||mrfixit58||11-13-2000||04:46 PM||||BroCar 87 wrote: "ALSO, for you older guys (hehe no offese) WHAT WAS THE COOL THING TO PUT ON YOUR 69 Camaro or 72 cuda??? stickers right???!!!(even though they were in the window, not on the panels as much as todays cars) Whether they be "hedman headers" or "cherry bomb exhaust" It was the cool thing to do! <BR>TO SHOW WHAT YOU HAVE UNDER/IN YOUR MUSCLE CARS!"<P>Coming from someone who used to own and drive a 72' Cuda... stickers WERE NOT necessary. The only one's who used to use stickers were the guys who drag raced their cars or the "wanna be's" who actually drove Camaros and Barracudas with factory no-power or sixes. For most of use, the "340 four barrel", "HEMI", and "SS 454" (etc) on the hood or fenders were enough. Just like the REAL V-TEC guys...<P>Of course, a sign that was helpful and could be placed in the window when needed was common. It usually read "Need Help, out of gas".   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Roy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by mrfixit58 (edited 11-13-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000010||Seanh||11-13-2000||07:01 PM||||I agree that putting stickers on your car that represnt things you dont have is stupid, but I do have quite a few stickers on my car with the stereo system manufacturers logos on them. What else do you think is ricey, besides the famous coffee can exhaust? I really dont consider that ricey. If thats what you like, then more power to ya. Its their car, who am I to tell them what looks good or crappy?<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/seanhsig2.gif">     <BR>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"If you smoke after sex, you're doing it way to fast".</I>||||reg||1
